1
00:00:01,126 --> 00:00:03,044
Where are those two and the ghost?

2
00:00:03,586 --> 00:00:04,962
They should be here...

3
00:00:04,963 --> 00:00:05,880
There.

4
00:00:07,048 --> 00:00:08,257
That's them.

5
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:09,550
- Those ones?
- Yeah.

6
00:00:09,551 --> 00:00:12,344
- This is easy. Piece of cake.
- Then untangle all three.

7
00:00:12,345 --> 00:00:14,514
Untangle them? Easy. Watch me.

8
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:17,100
Done staring yet?

9
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,769
Aren't your legs tired?

10
00:00:23,314 --> 00:00:25,774
Go get that pregnancy pillow for Ruyi.

11
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:27,484
Bought it when she was pregnant

12
00:00:27,485 --> 00:00:30,070
because her back hurt so much
she couldn't sleep,

13
00:00:30,071 --> 00:00:31,697
so I got it for her.

14
00:00:31,698 --> 00:00:33,699
It supports her back, belly and baby.

15
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,660
It's really useful. Hurry, go get it.

16
00:00:46,171 --> 00:00:49,340
It's long and wide enough
to support her whole body.

17
00:00:52,635 --> 00:00:54,471
Careful not to wake her up.

18
00:00:59,309 --> 00:01:00,351
I'm doing it.

19
00:01:00,977 --> 00:01:02,145
Why are you so close?

20
00:01:02,729 --> 00:01:03,937
I think...

21
00:01:03,938 --> 00:01:06,191
you're especially charming today.

22
00:01:08,526 --> 00:01:11,613
Are you only saying that
because I'm helping you out?

23
00:01:12,405 --> 00:01:13,531
Of course not.

24
00:01:36,971 --> 00:01:37,931
What?

25
00:01:38,431 --> 00:01:39,932
You hold her,

26
00:01:39,933 --> 00:01:41,434
I'll hold you.

27
00:01:49,442 --> 00:01:50,651
What are you doing?

28
00:01:50,652 --> 00:01:52,654
You're making it even tighter!

29
00:01:53,488 --> 00:01:54,446
No, wait...

30
00:01:54,447 --> 00:01:56,448
I'm the Matchmaker God.
I hold the red string,

31
00:01:56,449 --> 00:01:58,700
- so I'm tying them tighter.
- You promised!

32
00:01:58,701 --> 00:02:00,786
- I know, but...
- I'm tying it tighter.

33
00:02:00,787 --> 00:02:04,331
- I should've done it myself...
- Who's the Matchmaker God here?

34
00:02:04,332 --> 00:02:05,624
- You are.
- I'm done with you.

35
00:02:05,625 --> 00:02:06,835
No, you little...

36
00:03:04,726 --> 00:03:07,311
I didn't know Taozi liked you so much.

37
00:03:07,312 --> 00:03:08,855
Of course she does.

38
00:03:09,898 --> 00:03:11,941
Look over here.

39
00:03:13,067 --> 00:03:14,652
Idiot, she can't see that.

40
00:03:16,070 --> 00:03:17,237
Newborns can only see

41
00:03:17,238 --> 00:03:22,659
light and simple patterns,
within 20 cm of their eyes.

42
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:24,829
Are you even taking proper care of her?

43
00:03:25,747 --> 00:03:29,042
Some people say babies can see ghosts.

44
00:03:29,626 --> 00:03:30,792
- Hey.
- Taozi.

45
00:03:30,793 --> 00:03:32,044
No.

46
00:03:32,045 --> 00:03:33,754
- Really?
- You'll scare her.

47
00:03:33,755 --> 00:03:34,671
Go away!

48
00:03:34,672 --> 00:03:37,550
By the way,
are you actually looking for my grandma?

49
00:03:38,343 --> 00:03:42,554
Yeah. I checked the Northeast Coast,
but she wasn't there.

50
00:03:42,555 --> 00:03:45,016
Any idea where else she might be?

51
00:03:46,351 --> 00:03:47,393
Before she died,

52
00:03:49,938 --> 00:03:51,647
Grandma said she wanted to go

53
00:03:51,648 --> 00:03:54,150
up into the mountains to see the stars

54
00:03:55,318 --> 00:03:57,237
and ride a little mountain train.

55
00:03:58,863 --> 00:04:01,281
She grew up in Hengchun.

56
00:04:01,282 --> 00:04:03,075
Maybe she went back home?

57
00:04:03,076 --> 00:04:04,244
Hengchun?

58
00:04:05,328 --> 00:04:06,871
- Too far?
- Nope.

59
00:04:07,789 --> 00:04:10,958
Good thing I'm a Super Saiyan now.

60
00:04:10,959 --> 00:04:12,460
A Super what?

61
00:04:18,925 --> 00:04:20,468
My strawberry candy.

62
00:04:24,722 --> 00:04:25,931
A stone from Qixingtan Beach.

63
00:04:25,932 --> 00:04:27,100
Is that legal?

64
00:04:27,892 --> 00:04:28,935
I put it back.

65
00:04:29,811 --> 00:04:31,562
You've gotten really good at this.

66
00:04:32,438 --> 00:04:34,731
You can do it too after your seventh day.

67
00:04:34,732 --> 00:04:36,149
Are you nuts?

68
00:04:36,150 --> 00:04:37,610
What seventh day?

69
00:04:39,112 --> 00:04:40,321
Taozi.

70
00:04:41,906 --> 00:04:43,074
Hey, Brother Xiao.

71
00:04:44,033 --> 00:04:45,785
Okay, I'll be right there.

72
00:04:49,872 --> 00:04:51,165
Go...

73
00:04:56,337 --> 00:04:57,880
I should probably wake Ruyi.

74
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:02,176
Super Saiyan!

75
00:05:03,553 --> 00:05:05,596
Don't wake Ruyi up. She just fell asleep.

76
00:05:06,431 --> 00:05:09,141
What about Taozi, then?

77
00:05:09,142 --> 00:05:11,311
Reporting for duty! I'm here.

78
00:05:17,150 --> 00:05:19,319
Honey, you're awake. You okay?

79
00:05:20,445 --> 00:05:21,403
Go...

80
00:05:21,404 --> 00:05:23,280
bring Little Rice Cake to me.

81
00:05:23,281 --> 00:05:24,197
Little...

82
00:05:24,198 --> 00:05:26,242
Little Rice...

83
00:05:27,577 --> 00:05:29,245
Little Rice Cake...

84
00:05:38,463 --> 00:05:39,797
I'll take you to see her.

85
00:05:40,548 --> 00:05:42,883
Don't be sad, honey.

86
00:05:42,884 --> 00:05:45,469
Why is Little Rice Cake here?

87
00:05:45,470 --> 00:05:47,596
What happened to her?

88
00:05:47,597 --> 00:05:49,139
She...

89
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:52,392
A-Li, what did the doctor say?
Tell her. Hurry!

90
00:05:52,393 --> 00:05:56,355
The doctor said Little Rice Cake
inhaled some amniotic fluid.

91
00:05:57,523 --> 00:06:00,025
She'll be fine in a few days.
She'll be fine.

92
00:06:00,026 --> 00:06:03,070
How many days has it been?

93
00:06:03,071 --> 00:06:05,782
When can I hold her?

94
00:06:06,532 --> 00:06:08,742
I'll go ask again. I'll go check.

95
00:06:08,743 --> 00:06:11,745
It's okay. There, there, sweetheart.

96
00:06:11,746 --> 00:06:13,330
She'll be out in a few days.

97
00:06:13,331 --> 00:06:15,874
Come on, let's go...

98
00:06:15,875 --> 00:06:17,417
- It's okay.
- Okay, nothing...

99
00:06:17,418 --> 00:06:19,377
My Little Rice Cake...

100
00:06:19,378 --> 00:06:20,838
It's okay. It's okay.

101
00:06:44,112 --> 00:06:45,446
<i>I'm screwed.</i>

102
00:06:46,114 --> 00:06:49,575
If my wife finds out we lost our daughter,
she won't survive this.

103
00:06:51,911 --> 00:06:53,453
I couldn't protect my family.

104
00:06:53,454 --> 00:06:54,539
I'm ashamed.

105
00:06:56,082 --> 00:06:57,125
Brother Xiao,

106
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,502
the truth can't stay hidden.

107
00:07:00,294 --> 00:07:02,046
Why don't you stop

108
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:04,548
before this gets out of hand?

109
00:07:04,549 --> 00:07:08,261
Stop? How can I?
Look at your sister-in-law.

110
00:07:09,929 --> 00:07:11,430
I'll think of something.

111
00:07:11,431 --> 00:07:13,391
You think of something too!

112
00:07:14,142 --> 00:07:15,643
Better to get it over with.

113
00:07:16,144 --> 00:07:18,979
Brother Xiao, if you can't,
I'll be the bad guy.

114
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:21,064
- I'll tell her.
- No, don't!

115
00:07:21,065 --> 00:07:23,818
Do anything but tell her the truth.

116
00:07:24,986 --> 00:07:27,362
One lie takes ten more to cover it up.

117
00:07:27,363 --> 00:07:28,656
It's not worth it.

118
00:07:31,659 --> 00:07:33,493
Why don't we just text her?

119
00:07:33,494 --> 00:07:34,912
It's a shitty thing to do.

120
00:07:37,915 --> 00:07:39,709
Okay, sorry.

121
00:07:40,585 --> 00:07:41,961
I'll think of another way.

122
00:07:43,671 --> 00:07:45,505
That's weird. Where'd he go?

123
00:07:45,506 --> 00:07:48,508
He said he'd watch her. How irresponsible.

124
00:07:48,509 --> 00:07:51,636
Ruyi, you're wrong.
He's not being irresponsible.

125
00:07:51,637 --> 00:07:54,056
I told him I could take care of Taozi.

126
00:07:55,516 --> 00:07:56,391
Don't cry.

127
00:07:56,392 --> 00:07:59,311
Were you scared? No one was here for you.

128
00:07:59,312 --> 00:08:00,687
Are you uncomfortable?

129
00:08:00,688 --> 00:08:02,148
Too hot?

130
00:08:03,691 --> 00:08:06,569
I wish I could help somehow.

131
00:08:07,737 --> 00:08:08,988
What?

132
00:08:10,823 --> 00:08:12,949
Bills, bills, bills.

133
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:14,285
I'm broke!

134
00:08:15,036 --> 00:08:17,330
I've got money. You can have all of it.

135
00:08:20,208 --> 00:08:23,627
Ruyi, you can't go out and work.
It's too much for you.

136
00:08:23,628 --> 00:08:25,712
Who'll take care of Taozi?

137
00:08:25,713 --> 00:08:27,422
So noisy!

138
00:08:27,423 --> 00:08:29,591
How long is that baby gonna cry?

139
00:08:29,592 --> 00:08:32,803
A-Li's gone. Watch the talisman.
We just got our strength back.

140
00:08:33,846 --> 00:08:35,805
What are you two doing?

141
00:08:35,806 --> 00:08:38,309
Don't pick on Ruyi and Taozi
while A-Li's gone.

142
00:08:38,893 --> 00:08:39,809
You hear that?

143
00:08:39,810 --> 00:08:42,480
A-Li's not here.

144
00:08:43,606 --> 00:08:45,232
She pooped!

145
00:08:45,233 --> 00:08:46,316
No wonder it stinks.

146
00:08:46,317 --> 00:08:47,484
- Let's go.
- Move.

147
00:08:47,485 --> 00:08:48,902
Let's go wash you up.

148
00:08:48,903 --> 00:08:50,570
Don't go near them!

149
00:08:50,571 --> 00:08:51,739
What a psycho.

150
00:08:52,448 --> 00:08:54,282
Don't ignore me.

151
00:08:54,283 --> 00:08:55,200
Let go of me!

152
00:08:55,201 --> 00:08:56,660
- Let go!
- I'm warning you!

153
00:08:56,661 --> 00:08:58,036
- Just talk!
- Stop bullying!

154
00:08:58,037 --> 00:08:59,663
- Hands off! It's improper!
- Let go!

155
00:08:59,664 --> 00:09:02,166
I know I can untangle this.

156
00:09:03,417 --> 00:09:05,627
Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn't.

157
00:09:05,628 --> 00:09:06,962
- No way.
- You...

158
00:09:06,963 --> 00:09:08,297
Can you ask him to leave?

159
00:09:10,967 --> 00:09:13,301
No time for him. I need to untangle this.

160
00:09:13,302 --> 00:09:14,637
Suit yourself.

161
00:09:15,846 --> 00:09:18,307
He's still in rehab.
He seems pretty normal.

162
00:09:23,521 --> 00:09:24,604
Two more ghosts?

163
00:09:24,605 --> 00:09:26,356
This place is haunted!

164
00:09:26,357 --> 00:09:28,191
One, two, three... Three ghosts?

165
00:09:28,192 --> 00:09:30,903
- Oh, my God!
- Are these two ghosts single?

166
00:09:32,071 --> 00:09:34,614
What do you mean? So what?

167
00:09:34,615 --> 00:09:36,951
Just get those two ghosts together.

168
00:09:40,788 --> 00:09:42,248
No.

169
00:09:49,463 --> 00:09:52,216
Spray the love potion on all three ghosts?

170
00:10:39,639 --> 00:10:41,474
Come on. I'll drive you home.

171
00:10:43,434 --> 00:10:45,561
No, I meant her.

172
00:10:46,270 --> 00:10:47,145
No, thanks.

173
00:10:47,146 --> 00:10:48,605
- There is...
- No...

174
00:10:48,606 --> 00:10:50,066
- Yeah...
- No...

175
00:10:50,900 --> 00:10:53,318
- Sorry, the helmet?
- You don't need it.

176
00:10:53,319 --> 00:10:54,820
Can she borrow it?

177
00:11:03,913 --> 00:11:05,330
We're screwed.

178
00:11:05,331 --> 00:11:09,084
Taozi, Uncle A-Li's back.
I'll wash my hands, then hold you.

179
00:11:09,085 --> 00:11:10,294
No.

180
00:11:10,878 --> 00:11:12,420
I don't trust you.

181
00:11:12,421 --> 00:11:14,715
What? Why are you being so mean?

182
00:11:15,633 --> 00:11:18,802
You promised to watch her,
but you left her all alone.

183
00:11:18,803 --> 00:11:20,178
Where were you?

184
00:11:20,179 --> 00:11:21,679
It's okay, sweetie.

185
00:11:21,680 --> 00:11:24,432
I got an urgent phone call. I had to go.

186
00:11:24,433 --> 00:11:27,977
She's not even a month old.
Know how dangerous that is?

187
00:11:27,978 --> 00:11:31,272
I thought you'd come out if she cried...

188
00:11:31,273 --> 00:11:33,526
- Hello?
- I'll wash my hands and take her.

189
00:11:34,860 --> 00:11:35,735
Thank you.

190
00:11:35,736 --> 00:11:36,821
Let me help.

191
00:11:37,488 --> 00:11:38,823
No, thanks!

192
00:11:43,119 --> 00:11:44,245
I...

193
00:11:45,663 --> 00:11:48,415
<i>Adoption involves a lot
of procedures and regulations,</i>

194
00:11:48,416 --> 00:11:50,251
and strict screening process.

195
00:11:51,502 --> 00:11:55,464
Are you refusing to help
because of who my boss is?

196
00:11:56,424 --> 00:11:57,465
I'm really sorry,

197
00:11:57,466 --> 00:12:01,553
but we have to be very careful
when finding adoptive parents.

198
00:12:01,554 --> 00:12:02,971
My boss is very cautious.

199
00:12:02,972 --> 00:12:04,639
- Sorry.
- He's very careful.

200
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:07,476
- He can't risk any surprises.
- Sorry. Thanks.

201
00:12:08,644 --> 00:12:12,440
Brother Xiao,
it's not going to be that easy.

202
00:12:13,691 --> 00:12:14,817
Ruyi?

203
00:12:16,110 --> 00:12:17,194
Taozi?

204
00:12:26,495 --> 00:12:28,789
<i>Where are you? Hurry, or I'm canceling.</i>

205
00:12:30,499 --> 00:12:31,625
There, there...

206
00:12:32,209 --> 00:12:33,335
That's strange.

207
00:12:41,051 --> 00:12:42,343
Over here!

208
00:12:42,344 --> 00:12:45,306
Hi, I'm delivering to Ms. Chang in 10-3.

209
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:49,810
Elevator's broken. Take the stairs.
You can't leave it here.

210
00:12:52,313 --> 00:12:53,396
Then this...

211
00:12:53,397 --> 00:12:54,690
Chang Ruyi.

212
00:12:55,608 --> 00:12:58,109
Why are you here? What's with the outfit?

213
00:12:58,110 --> 00:13:00,945
I'm doing something for my boss.
I'll deliver it.

214
00:13:00,946 --> 00:13:03,948
- No, I can do it myself.
- It's okay.

215
00:13:03,949 --> 00:13:05,867
- Both?
- Yeah.

216
00:13:05,868 --> 00:13:08,120
Okay, wait here for me.

217
00:13:08,996 --> 00:13:09,997
Thank you.

218
00:13:15,044 --> 00:13:16,420
What...

219
00:13:17,129 --> 00:13:18,463
You pooped.

220
00:13:18,464 --> 00:13:19,964
Hold on.

221
00:13:19,965 --> 00:13:22,133
- Chang Ruyi, which unit?
- 10-3.

222
00:13:22,134 --> 00:13:23,886
- 10-3. Thanks.
- Right.

223
00:13:26,055 --> 00:13:28,640
Oh, Mommy totally forgot.

224
00:13:28,641 --> 00:13:31,392
Sorry. The guard wouldn't let Mommy
use the bathroom.

225
00:13:31,393 --> 00:13:32,936
Let's change you here, okay?

226
00:13:32,937 --> 00:13:34,812
That security guard was awful.

227
00:13:34,813 --> 00:13:36,898
He had no compassion at all.

228
00:13:36,899 --> 00:13:38,317
What's wrong with people?

229
00:13:41,070 --> 00:13:43,404
Chang Ruyi, just leave the trash here.

230
00:13:43,405 --> 00:13:45,323
I've got plastic bags in my car.

231
00:13:45,324 --> 00:13:46,241
It stinks.

232
00:13:46,242 --> 00:13:48,619
No, it doesn't. Taozi's so cute.

233
00:13:49,578 --> 00:13:51,372
She doesn't stink at all, does she?

234
00:13:54,625 --> 00:13:56,918
Let's put some diaper cream on.

235
00:13:56,919 --> 00:13:58,337
Feels good, right?

236
00:14:00,005 --> 00:14:02,049
Chang Ruyi, I'm sorry.

237
00:14:03,050 --> 00:14:06,262
I shouldn't have left Taozi alone
in the living room.

238
00:14:07,721 --> 00:14:09,056
Don't be mad.

239
00:14:10,599 --> 00:14:12,226
It won't happen again.

240
00:14:13,894 --> 00:14:15,061
What are you saying?

241
00:14:15,062 --> 00:14:16,730
Are you scolding me too?

242
00:14:17,314 --> 00:14:19,942
Tell your mommy
not to be mad at me anymore.

243
00:14:20,526 --> 00:14:21,860
Okay, Taozi?

244
00:14:21,861 --> 00:14:23,027
Oh, I see.

245
00:14:23,028 --> 00:14:24,153
Like this.

246
00:14:24,154 --> 00:14:25,322
There you go.

247
00:14:25,906 --> 00:14:27,658
Feels better now, doesn't it?

248
00:14:30,452 --> 00:14:32,662
Oh, I meant to ask you earlier.

249
00:14:32,663 --> 00:14:34,373
Why do you have a baby car seat?

250
00:14:36,375 --> 00:14:39,670
I bought it secondhand online.
Don't worry, I disinfected it.

251
00:14:40,546 --> 00:14:42,046
You bought it just for her?

252
00:14:42,047 --> 00:14:44,967
No, I just shop online sometimes.

253
00:14:47,636 --> 00:14:49,179
Why are you so good to Taozi?

254
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:51,848
Taozi's adorable.

255
00:14:51,849 --> 00:14:54,018
You can't help but want to spoil her.

256
00:14:56,604 --> 00:15:00,148
If I'd known you were doing deliveries
with her for money,

257
00:15:00,149 --> 00:15:01,399
I would've stopped you.

258
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:04,570
You're still recovering,
and she's not even a month old.

259
00:15:05,446 --> 00:15:07,947
If you need money, ask me.

260
00:15:07,948 --> 00:15:09,408
Pay me back later.

261
00:15:11,327 --> 00:15:14,662
I have money, stocks and company bonuses.

262
00:15:14,663 --> 00:15:16,289
When the money...

263
00:15:16,290 --> 00:15:19,250
When the baby's born,
I can help you raise it.

264
00:15:19,251 --> 00:15:21,170
Don't send the baby to an orphanage.

265
00:15:23,422 --> 00:15:24,465
What you said

266
00:15:25,215 --> 00:15:26,800
reminds me of someone.

267
00:15:27,593 --> 00:15:29,135
He was too good to us.

268
00:15:29,136 --> 00:15:31,638
So good that I felt like
I couldn't owe him anything more,

269
00:15:31,639 --> 00:15:33,765
so I left overnight.

270
00:15:33,766 --> 00:15:35,351
That's how I got scammed.

271
00:15:36,185 --> 00:15:37,436
Black-rimmed glasses?

272
00:15:38,187 --> 00:15:40,022
How did you know? Do you know him?

273
00:15:41,982 --> 00:15:44,735
Guys in black-rimmed glasses are nice.

274
00:15:45,611 --> 00:15:46,654
Is that so?

275
00:15:51,825 --> 00:15:52,992
Smells good.

276
00:15:52,993 --> 00:15:54,577
Go ahead. Eat while it's hot.

277
00:15:54,578 --> 00:15:56,037
Aren't you eating with me?

278
00:15:56,038 --> 00:15:57,372
I'm about to head out.

279
00:15:57,373 --> 00:15:59,583
- I'll eat first. I'm starving.
- Okay.

280
00:16:05,297 --> 00:16:08,549
After running around all day,
everything tastes so good.

281
00:16:08,550 --> 00:16:10,176
What do you mean?

282
00:16:10,177 --> 00:16:12,763
Just say my cooking's good.

283
00:16:15,349 --> 00:16:16,225
Delicious.

284
00:16:21,438 --> 00:16:22,647
I'll do it...

285
00:16:22,648 --> 00:16:25,566
Keep eating.
You eat first. I'll take care of it.

286
00:16:25,567 --> 00:16:27,611
You know I'm better at this anyway.

287
00:16:28,570 --> 00:16:30,239
Taozi!

288
00:16:30,948 --> 00:16:34,367
What's wrong? It's hot today, isn't it?

289
00:16:34,368 --> 00:16:35,703
Come to me.

290
00:16:38,831 --> 00:16:40,331
Is that okay?

291
00:16:40,332 --> 00:16:42,000
What's wrong?

292
00:16:42,001 --> 00:16:43,335
Better like this?

293
00:16:56,890 --> 00:16:58,642
Eat. Why are you staring?

294
00:16:59,643 --> 00:17:01,561
Never seen me calm a baby?

295
00:17:01,562 --> 00:17:04,856
Tell Mommy to take her time.

296
00:17:04,857 --> 00:17:06,149
Take your time.

297
00:17:06,150 --> 00:17:07,526
Taozi, did you just talk?

298
00:17:08,652 --> 00:17:09,778
I'm kidding.

299
00:17:20,122 --> 00:17:21,165
Taozi's asleep?

300
00:17:24,001 --> 00:17:26,670
Then go get some rest.
You've had a long day too.

301
00:17:27,546 --> 00:17:30,382
I'm looking for a job,
seeing if there are any openings.

302
00:17:32,217 --> 00:17:33,969
Just rest for now.

303
00:17:34,595 --> 00:17:35,804
Are you that broke?

304
00:17:36,597 --> 00:17:39,766
I'm going back to
the livestreaming company next month,

305
00:17:39,767 --> 00:17:43,145
but I want to save more for childcare.

306
00:17:46,190 --> 00:17:47,524
What?

307
00:17:59,787 --> 00:18:01,163
You free tomorrow morning?

308
00:18:02,456 --> 00:18:05,291
When I ask for clothes
during a livestream, stay off camera.

309
00:18:05,292 --> 00:18:06,501
