310
00:18:06,502 --> 00:18:07,835
Got it, got it.

311
00:18:07,836 --> 00:18:08,795
Seriously?

312
00:18:08,796 --> 00:18:12,006
You always say, "Got it, got it,"
then do the same thing again.

313
00:18:12,007 --> 00:18:13,925
How about I wear a mask next time?

314
00:18:13,926 --> 00:18:15,468
What's a mask gonna do?

315
00:18:15,469 --> 00:18:18,971
I told you to stay off camera.
Do you understand?

316
00:18:18,972 --> 00:18:20,224
Must I spell it out?

317
00:18:26,897 --> 00:18:29,357
Ruyi, what are you doing back here?

318
00:18:29,358 --> 00:18:31,067
Yeah, I had the baby.

319
00:18:31,068 --> 00:18:32,735
Are you livestreaming now?

320
00:18:32,736 --> 00:18:36,156
Yeah. The boss put me on livestreams.
It's been about three months.

321
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:39,784
