322
00:18:39,785 --> 00:18:42,578
She's your senior and just had a baby.

323
00:18:42,579 --> 00:18:44,205
Give her a break.

324
00:18:44,206 --> 00:18:45,999
You forgot how she treated me?

325
00:18:46,708 --> 00:18:48,168
