326
00:18:50,212 --> 00:18:51,629
Boss around?

327
00:18:51,630 --> 00:18:53,882
He's in the office.

328
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:56,301
I'll go see him.

329
00:18:57,761 --> 00:18:58,887
Good luck.

330
00:19:02,099 --> 00:19:03,683
Sure, no problem.

331
00:19:03,684 --> 00:19:05,643
- Okay.
- Boss.

332
00:19:05,644 --> 00:19:07,728
Why are you here?
Aren't you on maternity leave?

333
00:19:07,729 --> 00:19:11,274
I'm done resting.
You said I could come back next month.

334
00:19:11,275 --> 00:19:14,902
