I can still sell clothes.

335
00:19:14,903 --> 00:19:16,529
Forgot how good I am?

336
00:19:16,530 --> 00:19:19,490
No, it's because pregnancy
changed your figure,

337
00:19:19,491 --> 00:19:22,160
and everyone knows you had a baby.

338
00:19:22,161 --> 00:19:25,789
Our customers are mostly young
working women and women in their 30s.

339
00:19:26,540 --> 00:19:28,166
You don't fit our image anymore.

340
00:19:28,167 --> 00:19:32,128
Come on. Lots of livestreamers
still sell like crazy after having a baby.

341
00:19:32,129 --> 00:19:34,756
Forgot how much money I made this company?

342
00:19:35,841 --> 00:19:37,425
How could I forget?

343
00:19:37,426 --> 00:19:39,552
It's just a different market now.

344
00:19:39,553 --> 00:19:43,514
Don't make this hard for
either of us, okay?

345
00:19:43,515 --> 00:19:47,019
Look how much weight I've lost.
Business is bad.

346
00:19:49,813 --> 00:19:50,814
I get it.

347
00:19:51,523 --> 00:19:53,942
Sell me the clothes wholesale.
I'll do it myself.

348
00:19:57,487 --> 00:19:58,947
It won't affect you.

349
00:20:03,535 --> 00:20:05,369
