350
00:20:05,370 --> 00:20:09,165
It's our best-selling body wash
and those popular freebies.

351
00:20:09,166 --> 00:20:11,167
Customers ask about them all the time.

352
00:20:11,168 --> 00:20:14,337
If I buy them wholesale and resell them,
I should make good money.

353
00:20:14,338 --> 00:20:16,381
Call it my severance.

354
00:20:17,257 --> 00:20:20,259
It's great you want to livestream
from home.

355
00:20:20,260 --> 00:20:23,387
