373
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:07,598
Today, I'm introducing this tortoise-shell
and deer-antler chicken essence.

374
00:21:07,599 --> 00:21:10,685
Think I'm looking pretty healthy?

375
00:21:10,686 --> 00:21:13,479
I drank this every day
