- I'll take 30 bottles.

384
00:21:34,793 --> 00:21:36,794
- Thirty bottles.
- Ten for Brother Bang.

385
00:21:36,795 --> 00:21:38,087
Does Brother Bang need any?

386
00:21:38,088 --> 00:21:40,549
Thanks, bro. I use a lot of shampoo.

387
00:21:42,050 --> 00:21:44,177
Smells amazing.

388
00:21:45,804 --> 00:21:49,016
<i>You can't smell it through the screen.
Try it yourself.</i>

389
00:21:53,562 --> 00:21:56,898
<i>It's smooth, not gamey at all,
and great for everyone.</i>

390
00:22:00,068 --> 00:22:02,862
<i>It's lunchtime, so it's quiet.</i>

391
00:22:02,863 --> 00:22:06,408
<i>We'll be live again this afternoon.
Come back then to order.</i>

392
00:22:07,326 --> 00:22:09,660
Hello, Ms. Chen. I mean no harm.

393
00:22:09,661 --> 00:22:12,496
