- No, thanks...

397
00:22:18,295 --> 00:22:19,338
Thank you.

398
00:22:20,714 --> 00:22:22,090
"No" what?

399
00:22:26,511 --> 00:22:27,721
Brother Xiao,

400
00:22:28,555 --> 00:22:32,142
with so few babies these days,
where am I supposed to find a baby girl?

401
00:22:34,603 --> 00:22:35,978
What are you wearing?

402
00:22:35,979 --> 00:22:42,152
Hardly anyone watched last time,
so I need a gimmick to draw people in.

403
00:22:42,986 --> 00:22:44,404
No one placed an order?

404
00:22:47,824 --> 00:22:50,326
It's okay. My grandma always said,

405
00:22:50,327 --> 00:22:53,037
"Everything's hard at first,
messy in the middle,

406
00:22:53,038 --> 00:22:54,497
but works out in the end."

407
00:22:54,498 --> 00:22:56,208
Just keep going.

408
00:22:59,002 --> 00:23:00,337
Are you free later?

409
00:23:01,713 --> 00:23:04,049
<i>Welcome to Ruyi Living.</i>

410
00:23:07,344 --> 00:23:09,596
This chicken essence is delicious.

411
00:23:10,806 --> 00:23:14,058
<i>It has tortoise-shell
and deer-antler extract</i>

412
00:23:14,059 --> 00:23:20,022
<i>to support joint health and mobility.</i>

413
00:23:20,023 --> 00:23:22,317
<i>Great for anyone who works out.</i>

414
00:23:23,401 --> 00:23:26,195
<i>Let's see what he can do.
Oh, my God, he's flying!</i>

415
00:23:26,196 --> 00:23:29,365
<i>He can do a handstand!
This chicken essence is amazing!</i>

416
00:23:29,366 --> 00:23:32,827
<i>He's even doing handstand push-ups.
That's how powerful it is.</i>

417
00:23:32,828 --> 00:23:34,662
<i>Flexible joints and tons of energy!</i>

418
00:23:34,663 --> 00:23:36,163
<i>Snow angel.</i>

419
00:23:36,164 --> 00:23:39,334
<i>He can even do a snow angel!
This chicken essence is amazing!</i>

420
00:23:41,586 --> 00:23:43,462
Someone says your pecs are fake.

421
00:23:43,463 --> 00:23:44,588
What did you just say?

422
00:23:44,589 --> 00:23:46,757
<i>Those saying they're fake, look closely.</i>

423
00:23:46,758 --> 00:23:47,926
<i>Look closely.</i>

424
00:23:54,599 --> 00:23:56,100
<i>Check out these huge pecs!</i>

425
00:23:56,101 --> 00:23:58,435
<i>- They're huge!
- Exactly.</i>

426
00:23:58,436 --> 00:24:00,104
<i>That's how good it is!</i>

427
00:24:00,105 --> 00:24:03,607
<i>Only 50 sets available today.
Buy two, get one free.</i>

428
00:24:03,608 --> 00:24:04,692
<i>Get yours now!</i>

429
00:24:04,693 --> 00:24:05,985
<i>Order now!</i>

430
00:24:05,986 --> 00:24:07,444
<i>- Fifty sets.
- We still have...</i>

431
00:24:07,445 --> 00:24:08,572
<i>Fifty sets.</i>

432
00:24:09,739 --> 00:24:11,157
<i>Huge pecs!</i>

433
00:24:11,158 --> 00:24:13,367
That's how amazing our chicken essence is!

434
00:24:13,368 --> 00:24:15,619
Only 50 sets. Buy two, get one free.

435
00:24:15,620 --> 00:24:17,080
<i>Get yours now!</i>

436
00:24:18,206 --> 00:24:19,957
<i>Taozi, no. Not here.</i>

437
00:24:19,958 --> 00:24:21,168
<i>It's...</i>

438
00:24:21,293 --> 00:24:23,043
SENDING LOVE ×2

439
00:24:23,044 --> 00:24:25,546
<i>No, he's just a friend of mine.</i>

440
00:24:25,547 --> 00:24:28,258
<i>- That's my daughter.
- Taozi, no. Taozi...</i>

441
00:24:29,342 --> 00:24:31,969
<i>The point is, this chicken essence
is delicious.</i>

442
00:24:31,970 --> 00:24:35,264
<i>Only 50 sets. Buy two, get one free.</i>

443
00:24:35,265 --> 00:24:37,684
<i>Order now while you can! Don't miss out!</i>

444
00:24:38,351 --> 00:24:39,519
Taozi, not here.

445
00:24:40,729 --> 00:24:41,938
I'll get it.

446
00:24:43,481 --> 00:24:46,525
<i>Thanks for watching, everyone.
That's it for today.</i>

447
00:24:46,526 --> 00:24:48,903
<i>Remember, only 50 sets available,
buy two, get one free!</i>

448
00:24:48,904 --> 00:24:50,613
