456
00:25:08,506 --> 00:25:10,257
No point wasting it, right?

457
00:25:10,258 --> 00:25:12,051
The bottom two are a little rotten,

458
00:25:12,052 --> 00:25:13,844
but you can just cut those parts off.

459
00:25:13,845 --> 00:25:15,262
Right.

460
00:25:15,263 --> 00:25:17,181
- Thank you.
- You know, I still remember

461
00:25:17,182 --> 00:25:19,850
