chicken essence that time.

462
00:25:19,851 --> 00:25:24,813
That chicken essence was great.
You even came to see if I was still alive.

463
00:25:24,814 --> 00:25:27,399
- It was the least we could do.
- So kind of you.

464
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:29,068
I came to thank you.

465
00:25:29,069 --> 00:25:32,780
I sold chicken essence today.
I'll give you some more.

466
00:25:32,781 --> 00:25:34,198
Really?

467
00:25:34,199 --> 00:25:35,950
- Chicken essence?
- My pleasure.

468
00:25:35,951 --> 00:25:37,243
Stay healthy.

469
00:25:37,244 --> 00:25:40,247
